    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="El. 49.10">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> El. 49.10</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ic ða Ælfred Westseaxna cyning eallum minnum witum þas geeowde, ⁊ hie ða cwædon, þæt him þæt licode eallum to healdanne.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">I, Alfred, king of the West Saxons, then presented these [rulings] to all my counselors, and they then said, that it pleased them all to hold [them].</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">I, then, Alfred, King of the West Saxons, have shown these to all my councillors, and they have declared that it met with the approval of all, that they should be observed.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ic ða ælfred Westseaxna cyning eallum minnum witum, þas geeowde, ⁊ hie ða cwædon, þæt him þæt licode eallum to healdanne.</ab>
      </div>
